OL,3,GNEWSATwo people arrested after man's
OL,4,Aunexplained death
OL,5,
OL,6,FTwo people have been arrested following
OL,7,Fthe "sudden and unexplained" death of a
OL,8,Fman in York, police have said.
OL,10,FThe 28-year-old was found collapsed by
OL,11,Fparamedics at an address on Wood Steet
OL,12,Fin the Heworth area at about 23:00 BST
OL,13,Fon Friday.
OL,15,FHe died in hospital in the early hours
OL,16,Fof Saturday, a North Yorkshire Police
OL,17,Fspokesperson said.
OL,19,FA 54-year-old man and a 36-year-old
OL,20,Fwoman have been arrested in connection
OL,21,Fwith the investigation and they remain
OL,22,Fin custody, the spokesperson added.
OL,23,APub: 27-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
